<p>match between Natal and Australia at Kingsmead on Saturday:</p>
<p>Natal first innings 335 (Mark Bruyns 105, Dale Benkenstein</p>
<p>103; Jason Gillespie 4-71)</p>
<p>Australia first innings 370 (Mark Waugh 124, Michael Bevan</p>
<p>52; Pat Symcox 4-117)</p>
<p>Natal second innings (overnight 21-0)</p>
